  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey side and first-floor rear extension in conjunction with the existing gable end roof and rear dormer, would give rise to an unsympathetic, incongruous, bulky, obtrusive and contrived form of development which would fail to respect the scale, character, massing, composition and design of the host dwellinghouse and neighbouring properties. The proposal would result in a detrimental impact to the&amp;nbsp;character and appearance of the subject dwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1,&amp;nbsp;D.11 and D.12) of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;"
